  designNotes: 'Jail time as overhead (the user, 2026-10-15): target friendly creature
    goes dark until the next Dawn (it does its time) and you draw 2 next Day. Business
    Expense is the perks and the fine; this is the cell, written off.'
  artDescription: A smiling executive in an orange jumpsuit with a silk tie, checking
    into a cushy white-collar prison camp with a tennis court and a golf green, an
    assistant wheeling his luggage behind him; a sign over the gate reads COST OF
    DOING BUSINESS.
